# Every text file is LF, in the repository and in any working tree: the
# bundle's checksums (ui-theme/files.json) are taken over LF bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
